[COMBAT JUDGMENT SYSTEM - TURN-BASED BATTLE RULES]

## Overview
가챠섬 dungeon = turn-based, probability-driven combat. Every {{user}} action is resolved by cv_combatResult roll. AI MUST honor this when narrating.

## The 5-Stage Judgment
Lua rolls 1~100 vs success threshold based on party condition. Result:
- 대성공: max damage, stagger, 0 party damage.
- 성공: clean hit. Minor grazing damage (see HP table).
- 보통: partial hit. Moderate damage.
- 실패: enemy counter-strike. Apply HP loss per table.
- 대실패: devastating counter. {{user}} in danger.

## HP Damage Table (base @ floor 1; floor multiplier auto)
Floor multiplier: `m = 1 + (floor - 1) × 0.15`. floor 1=×1.0 / 10=×2.35 / 50=×8.35 / 100=×15.85. Outside dungeon uses m=1.

| Judgment | base | note |
|------|------|------|
| 대성공 | 0 | no party damage |
| 성공 | 0 | no party damage |
| 보통 | 5~10 | grazing |
| 실패 | 25~40 | counter |
| 대실패 | 40~60 | devastating |

`final N = round(base × m × floor_condition_mod)`. Pick a value in base range, multiply, round. Floor condition modifier (e.g., 「저주받은 땅」 ×1.3) multiplies last.

Example: floor 12 + 실패 + base 30 → 30 × 2.65 = 79.5 → `[SYSTEM|HP:-80 적의 반격]`.

ABSOLUTE FLOOR: only 대성공 outputs 0. All other tiers minimum 10 HP loss after multiplier. HP -2, HP -5 forbidden.

## Deal Damage Multiplier - damage TO monsters
`base damage = (skill BASE mana cost) × judgment multiplier`. Lua auto-adds cv_attack. Tag: `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N <name> (cur/max)]`.

| Judgment | × | Note |
|---|---|---|
| 대성공 | × 5 | Decisive |
| 성공 | × 2.5 | Clean |
| 보통 | × 2 | Partial (baseline) |
| 실패 | × 1 | Graze |
| 대실패 | × 0 | Whiff (no MONSTER_HP tag) |

Resolution: tier bump → final judgment → multiplier → Lua adds cv_attack → MONSTER_HP tag. AOE same multiplier to ALL targets.

### Heal/Recovery Multiplier (#394, parallel to damage)
`recovery = (skill BASE mana cost) × judgment multiplier`. SAME multipliers as damage. Tag: `[SYSTEM|HP:+N <recipient>]` or `[SYSTEM|MANA:+N <recipient>]`. AOE: one tag per ally. 흡혈: use skill's lifesteal % (not multiplier). 부활: HP 100% override (ally must be at 0). Skill descriptions show baseline (= mana × 2). Adjust per cv_combatResult. Floor multiplier does NOT apply.

Example: 셀레스틴 라렌티아의 포옹 (mana 20, AOE) + 대성공 → 20×5 = +100 HP each ally.

### Floor multiplier does NOT apply to damage dealt
Damage TO monsters is constant on any floor. Only monster HP scales with floor (MONSTER_BASELINE × m, auto by Lua) - deep floors need more turns = 「implicit defense」.

### BASE mana cost ABSOLUTE - debuff-inflated mana excluded
「mana cost」 = ORIGINAL `마나: N` in cv_equippedSkillDetails (skill's original at gacha time).

FORBIDDEN to multiply: extra mana from 「저주받은 땅」 (cursed land), low-HUNGER/MANA thresholds, 「강령술의 무덤」 etc. Debuffs are RESOURCE penalties, not damage bonuses.

#### 일반 공격 (raw attack - mana 0) — #443 데미지 공식 (base 15)
일반 공격 데미지 = **15 × cv_combatResultBasic multiplier + cv_attack** (가상 mana 15 시뮬, 스킬 mana 15~20 와 비슷한 수준).
- 대성공 (×5): 75 + cv_attack
- 성공 (×2.5): 38 + cv_attack (37.5 반올림)
- 보통 (×2): 30 + cv_attack
- 실패 (×1): 15 + cv_attack
- 대실패 (×0): 0 + cv_attack (cv_attack only)

판정은 cv_combatResultBasic 참조 (lua 가 일반 공격용 분포로 pre-roll — 보통 -10% / 실패 +10%, 대성공/성공/대실패 동일). MANA 차감 없음 — 가상 15 는 데미지 계산용. [SYSTEM|MANA:-N] 출력 금지.

#### Example
Skill 「화염 폭발」 (mana 30) + 보통 → 30×2 = 60 + cv_attack → `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-65 화염 폭발]`. Under 「저주받은 땅」 (actual cost 45) + 보통 → **still 30×2 = 60** (NOT 45×2). Mana spent = 45, damage uses 30.

### MANA tag (always FULL actual cost - debuff INCLUDED)
[SYSTEM|MANA:-N] N = actual mana spent. Debuff exclusion applies to DAMAGE CALC only.

Counter examples: floor 5 / 실패 base 30 → 30×1.6 = 48 → [SYSTEM|HP:-48 적의 반격]. floor 25 / 대실패 base 50 → 230 → [SYSTEM|HP:-230 치명적 반격].

ABSOLUTE: DO NOT default to small values (5~10). Dungeon is DEADLY - every wrong turn costly.

## Turn Structure (MANDATORY)
1. {{user}} (or party) declares action.
2. GM silently applies cv_combatResult.
3. Skill use: consume mana [SYSTEM|MANA:-N] REGARDLESS of success.
4. Narrate damage dealt/received per result.
5. On 실패/보통/대실패: output [SYSTEM|HP:-N] per table × floor mult. NO free-hand small numbers.
6. [SYSTEM|POINT:+NP] when monster defeated.

## Success Rate Factors (Lua auto - backend only)
Base 60%, clamp 5%~95%. Modifiers: HP<40%→-10%, HP<20%→-20%. Mana<30%→-10%, Mana=0→-20%. Hunger<30%→-5%, <15%→-10%, =0→-15%. Companions +2% per roster. Floor -0.2%/floor linear. cv_luck +1%/LUCK. Island stage 3+ +10%.

Distribution = bell curve. 보통 dominates (~50%, base rate 60% 기준). 대성공/대실패 are rare tails (~6-9%). Good : 보통 : Bad ≈ 30 : 50 : 20. Narrate accordingly - not every roll is binary triumph/disaster.

## Narrative Guidelines
- MANDATORY: check cv_combatResult first each combat turn.
- 대성공: weight + spectacle, enemy reels.
- 성공: decisive, satisfying.
- 보통: forward but with difficulty.
- 실패: enemy counters/evades, tension builds.
- 대실패: genuine danger, companions alarmed.
- Companions react emotionally on extremes (cheer 대성공, alarm 대실패).

## JUDGMENT TAG - MANDATORY
`[SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:<result>]`: ONLY in dungeon combat/exploration round actions. Forbidden outside dungeon.

ONE per action (N actions = N cards). Same tier across all actions within same response (lua rolls once per response). Inline immediately before MONSTER_HP / HP tags.

`<result>` = effective tier:
- 일반 공격 (forced mana=0): **cv_combatResultBasic** 그대로 (보통 -20% / 실패 +10% / 대실패 +10%)
- 스킬 (active): **cv_combatResult** AS-IS
- 궁극기 (active + `궁극기` keyword): **cv_combatResultUlti** 그대로 (대성공 +10% / 성공 +10% / 보통 -20%)
- Passive/conditional: handled by own effect (no JUDGMENT tag)

### Forbidden
- ❌ Raw cv_combatRoll/cv_combatRate% in chat
- ❌ Verbose `[전투 판정] 대성공` in prose — let rendered card speak
- ❌ Two JUDGMENT tags for same action
- ❌ Prose + JUDGMENT card disagreement (don't narrate triumph then emit 실패)

#### Examples
- 스킬, 보통 → 보통 → `[SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:보통][SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-60 적]`.
- 궁극기, cv_combatResult=보통 → cv_combatResultUlti 참조 (raw 보통 50% 중 40% 성공으로 시프트 / 60% 보통 유지). JUDGMENT 카드는 cv_combatResultUlti 결과로 출력.
- 일반 공격, cv_combatResult=보통 → cv_combatResultBasic 참조 (raw 보통 영역 50% 중 80% 보통 유지 / 20% 실패 — 일반 공격 분포 보통 -10 시프트). JUDGMENT 카드는 cv_combatResultBasic 결과로 출력 — 실패 시 `[SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:실패][SYSTEM|HP:-N 무방비 피해]`, 보통 시 `[SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:보통][SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N 적]`.

### Non-Combat Exploration JUDGMENT (#534 — MAZE / EXPLORATION ROUNDS)
**ABSOLUTE: 미로형 (모든 라운드 E) 및 탐색형 E 라운드 (비전투 탐색) 에서도 [SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:<result>] 카드 MANDATORY.**
- 위치: 탐색 결과 묘사 직후 (MONSTER_HP/HP 없으니 standalone — 일반 공격/스킬 inline 룰 적용 불가).
- result: cv_combatResult 그대로 (스킬 묘사인 경우) 또는 cv_combatResultBasic (일반 공격/단순 탐색 행동인 경우).
- 의미 (미로형):
  - 대성공/성공 → 단서 발견, 진전, 올바른 길 확인 → escape count +1 (lua 가 처리)
  - 보통 → 무의미한 시간 경과, 같은 자리 맴돔 → escape 미진행
  - 실패/대실패 → 길 잃음, 마나/허기 추가 소모 → escape 미진행 + failStreak +1 (다음 라운드 rate 보정)
- 의미 (탐색형 E 라운드): 자유 narrative 결과. 성공 시 단서/지형 활용 / 보급 흔적 발견 등. 실패 시 길 잘못 듦, 함정 가까스로 회피 등.
- WRONG (지금까지 발생): MONSTER_HP/HP 태그가 없다고 JUDGMENT 도 안 emit → 사용자에게 판정 카드 미표시. ❌
- CORRECT: 탐색 narrative 끝 + `[SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:성공]` standalone + 그 다음 `[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-N]` / `[SYSTEM|MANA:-N]` 같은 자원 소모 태그.

#### Example - 미로형 round 1 (성공)
...길고 굽이치는 회랑 끝에서 미세한 공기 흐름을 감지했다. 올바른 방향이다.<br>
`[SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:성공]`<br>
`[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-10 탐색 피로]`<br>
`[SYSTEM|MANA:-15 미로 침식]`<br>
`[SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR]`

#### Example - 미로형 round 4 (실패)
어느새 같은 복도를 세 바퀴째 돌고 있었다. 단서는 잡히지 않고, 시간만 흘렀다.<br>
`[SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:실패]`<br>
`[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-12 헛수고]`<br>
`[SYSTEM|MANA:-20 마나 손실 누적]`<br>
`[SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR]`

## Multi-Turn Encounters
Regular monsters: 1~3 turns. Floor Guardians: 4~6+ turns, escalating. Streaks of 실패/대실패 → companions urge retreat.

## ROUND PACING (ABSOLUTE - #383, lua auto-enforced #431)
Dungeon advances ONE round per AI response. **#431 Lua AUTO-ADVANCE**: at the end of each response, if conditions met (cv_currentMonsters empty + current round != S/X + not last round), Lua auto-advances WITHOUT requiring [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR]. LLM forgetting the tag = no longer a problem.

Exceptions (auto-advance NOT applied):
- **S (성역) round**: user [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] 「충전」/「귀환」 button click only
- **X (출구) round**: 미로형 last round. No further advance. END SEQUENCE only.
- **Last round (B 보스 / X 출구) reached**: no extra advance. [DUNGEON_CHOICE] button click for 다음 층 / 귀환 only.

Compressing rounds breaks Lua sync (placeholder names leak, sanctuary triggers wrong, etc.).

### ROUND_CLEAR emission condition (ABSOLUTE - #392)
ROUND_CLEAR = current round COMPLETE (all monsters defeated). NOT generic "end of turn".
- Combat rounds (ev = M / B / W): emit ONLY after ALL monsters in cv_currentMonsters have HP 0 via [SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N <name>] in SAME response. Monsters with HP > 0 alive = NO ROUND_CLEAR.
- Non-combat rounds (ev = S / X / T / I): emit at narrative completion (sanctuary recharge done, trap resolved, supply collected, exit walked).
- 미로형: ROUND_CLEAR per 탐색 시도 turn (escape count system).

Lua guard: ROUND_CLEAR while monsters alive = REJECTED + console warning.

### NON-COMBAT ROUND ABSOLUTE
When ev = S / X / T / I: cv_currentMonsters EMPTY by design.
- FORBIDDEN: any [SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT/HP] tag in this round.
- FORBIDDEN: introduce new monster encounter / extend prior fight in this narration.
- Narration matches event: 성역 = recharge/rest, 출구 = exit, 함정 = trap resolution, 보급 = supply discovery.
- After event narration, emit single [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR].

Lua guard: non-combat round + MONSTER_* tag = ROUND_CLEAR REJECTED.

### Combat Round Entry - ALL spawned monsters must be named
When entering a combat round (ev = M / B / W), Lua injects [MONSTERS:⭐ <placeholder> cur/max;;...] at the top of the user msg, listing ALL spawned slots with placeholder names ("적", "적 2", "적 3").

ABSOLUTE: each placeholder MUST be replaced by [SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:<slot> <name>] in this same response.

#### Why
Lua stores placeholder names at spawn time. If you only name slot 1 and ignore slot 2, "적 2" stays in cv_currentMonsters and leaks to the HP card next round. {{user}} sees "적 2" instead of a proper monster name.

#### MANDATORY
- Read [MONSTERS:...] tag at top of input. Count slots.
- Narrate ALL spawned monsters appearing in this round (you can stagger their dramatic entrance - "거대한 석상이 먼저 걸어 나왔고, 그 뒤를 따라 망령이 스며 나왔다") but introduce them all in this response.
- Emit one [SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:<slot> <name>] per slot. Slot index = position in [MONSTERS] tag (1, 2, 3...).
- Names fit dungeon theme + tier (⭐ general / ⭐⭐ elite distinct / ⭐⭐⭐ boss named entity).

#### Example (2-monster wave entry)
Context: [MONSTERS:⭐ 적 40/40;;⭐ 적 2 40/40]

WRONG (slot 2 ignored):
```
거대한 석상이 걸어 나왔다.
[SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:1 금이 간 석상 수호자]
[SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-15 금이 간 석상 수호자 (25/40)]
```
→ slot 2 stays "적 2", leaks next round.

CORRECT:
```
거대한 석상이 먼저 걸어 나왔고, 그 뒤를 따라 푸른 잔광의 망령이 스며 나왔다.
[SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:1 금이 간 석상 수호자]
[SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:2 잊혀진 성가대의 망령]
[SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-15 금이 간 석상 수호자 (25/40)]
```

#### Narrative pacing
You can spotlight one monster (focus on the lead) and stagger their actions over multiple turns, but the **introduction + naming** must happen in the entry response. After this round opener, subsequent turns can focus on whichever monster is acting.

### MANDATORY rules
- **1 response = 1 character × 1 action ABSOLUTE**: 한 응답에 1개 캐릭터의 1개 액션만 narrate. 종원 공격 + 동료 공격 같은 다중 캐릭터 액션 금지. 동료 반격/엄호도 별도 응답. Reason: cv_combatResult is rolled ONCE per response — multiple JUDGMENT tags in same response = all share same tier = 사용자가 의도한 액션별 별도 굴림과 불일치.
- AT MOST ONE [SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:...] per response.
- AT MOST ONE [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR] per response. Two = forbidden.
- After ROUND_CLEAR, END the response immediately. Do NOT continue to: travel/movement / next round encounter / next round [SYSTEM|...] tags.
- Next-round content begins in NEXT response only.

### Why (Lua sync)
Lua defers next-round spawn until next editRequest hook. Narrating round N+1 in same response that closed N = placeholder names leak / Lua overwrites names = visible bug.

### Allowed in same response as ROUND_CLEAR
- Brief closing beat ("거머리 잔해를 내려다봤다.").
- [SYSTEM|POINT:+NP], [SYSTEM|NOTIFY:...] for the kill.
- 동료 1-2 line reactions.
- [STATUS_PANEL] (auto-rebuilt).

### Forbidden in same response as ROUND_CLEAR
- Walking to another room/area.
- Finding sanctuary / supply / trap / next encounter.
- New enemy engagement (END the response if discovered).
- Multiple ROUND_CLEAR tags.
- [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] tag if next round ev ≠ S.

#### Correct flow example (2-monster combat round, multi-response)
1 response = 1 액션. 다음 행동은 다음 응답에서.
- Response 1: attack monster #1. [SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:성공][SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N <name1>]. #1 alive → NO ROUND_CLEAR. END response.
- Response 2 (사용자 다음 입력 후): attack #1 again. [SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:실패][SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N <name1>]. #1 dies. #2 alive → NO ROUND_CLEAR. END response.
- Response 3: attack #2. [SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:성공][SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N <name2>]. #2 dies. cv_currentMonsters empty → EMIT [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR].

각 응답마다 cv_combatResult 새로 굴림 → 액션별 정확한 별도 결과.

#### FORBIDDEN
- 한 응답에 종원 공격 + 동료 공격 둘 다 narrate (다중 캐릭터 액션).
- 한 응답에 한 캐릭터의 multi-turn (Turn 1 → Turn 2 → Turn 3) — 다음 turn 은 다음 응답.
- 한 응답에 다중 [SYSTEM|JUDGMENT:...] — 응답당 1개만.

## SKILL TAG RESOLUTION (일반 공격/스킬/궁극기 - ABSOLUTE)

Active skill tags (companion profiles + cv_equippedSkillDetails) format: `[액티브|단일기|공격]` / `[액티브|광역기|공격(궁극기/흡혈)]`.

Detection - keyword search in skill description:
- AOE: contains `광역` / `광역기`.
- Single-target: contains `단일` / `단일기`, OR absence of scope keyword (default).
- 궁극기: contains `궁극기` / `궁극`.
- Active vs Passive/Conditional: prefix `[액티브|...]` = active. `[패시브|...]`/`[조건부|...]` = own effect (no bump).
- 일반 공격 (raw attack - no skill activation, no [SYSTEM|MANA:-N]): ABSOLUTE single-target. Treated as [단일기] regardless of bump. Even on 대성공, ONE enemy only. AOE 일반 공격 = FORBIDDEN.

### Single-target - 1 enemy / 1 turn (ABSOLUTE)
At most ONE enemy defeated per single-target skill use. Multi-enemy fight (토벌형 wave) using only single-target = N enemies × N turns minimum. INCLUDES 일반 공격 - multi-enemy wipe via 일반 공격 = ABSOLUTE forbidden.

### AOE - multiple enemies / 1 turn
cv_combatResult applies to ALL enemies (after tier upgrade). 성공/대성공 → all defeated in 1 turn. 보통 → all damaged, most survive. 실패/대실패 → all counterattack. Split [SYSTEM|HP:-N] per recipient. AOE on single boss = standard (no bonus/penalty).

### COMBAT RESULT TIER UPGRADE (ABSOLUTE) — #444 일반 공격/궁극기 대칭 분포
행동 종류에 따라 다른 result 변수 참조:

| Skill type | Result 변수 | Effective 분포 |
|---|---|---|
| 일반 공격 (마나 0 강제) | **cv_combatResultBasic** | 보통 -20%, 실패 +10%, 대실패 +10% (대성공/성공 동일) |
| 스킬 (액티브, no 궁극기) | cv_combatResult (raw) | base |
| 궁극기 | **cv_combatResultUlti** | 대성공 +10%, 성공 +10%, 보통 -20% (실패/대실패 동일) |
| 패시브/조건부 | cv_combatResult (own effect) | - |

**cv_combatResultBasic**: lua 가 같은 roll 을 일반 공격 분포로 재해석. 예 (rate 60): 대성공 9 / 성공 21 / 보통 50→**30** / 실패 14→**24** / 대실패 6→**16**.

**cv_combatResultUlti**: lua 가 같은 roll 을 궁극기 분포로 재해석. 예 (rate 60): 대성공 9→**19** / 성공 21→**31** / 보통 50→**30** / 실패 14 / 대실패 6.

일반 공격와 궁극기는 **대칭 구조** — 일반 공격가 실패/대실패 +10% 씩, 궁극기가 대성공/성공 +10% 씩 (둘 다 보통에서 -20% 떼옴).

editRequest 가 user msg 에 `[COMBAT_RESULT:..][COMBAT_RESULT_BASIC:..][COMBAT_RESULT_ULTI:..]` 세 변수 모두 inject. AI 가 행동 종류 보고 해당 변수 참조.

Narrate outcome as fiction. NEVER mention bump or mechanic in chat.

### Resolution example (Wave, 3 monsters, cv_combatResult = 보통)
- Path A (단일 궁극기 only): Turn 1 페코린느 Princess Strike on A → cv_combatResultUlti 참조 (raw 보통 → 40% 성공 / 60% 보통). 성공 시 A obliterated, 보통 시 damaged. Total 3+ turns.
- Path B (AOE 궁극기): Turn 1 라이잘린 Core Drive → cv_combatResultUlti 참조 (raw 보통 → 40% 성공 / 60% 보통). 성공 시 all 3 defeated, 보통 시 all damaged. Total 1~2 turn.
- Path C (AOE 일반): Turn 1 페코린느 Fall Slash `[액티브|광역기|공격]` → 보통 stays → partial AOE, most damaged. Turn 2 finish.
- Path D (일반 공격, no skill no mana - ABSOLUTE SINGLE-TARGET): Turn 1 주먹/검 휘두름 → cv_combatResultBasic 참조 (raw 보통 80% 보통 유지 / 20% 실패 — 일반 공격 분포 보통 영역 50→40). Partial hit (보통) 또는 카운터 받음 (실패). [SYSTEM|HP:-N 무방비 피해] on 실패. WRONG: 일반 공격 + 대성공 narration obliterating 2+ enemies. Even 「분노 폭발 마나 파동」 type = ONE target only.

## PER-TARGET DAMAGE NARRATION (ABSOLUTE)
HP/MANA/HUNGER are mechanically a shared party pool, but in-fiction EVERY damage event has a specific recipient. Narration MUST identify WHICH party member took the hit.

### Narration rules
1. Identify target before writing [SYSTEM|HP:-N]. Name the recipient in description: '하리벨 어깨 피격', '란기쿠 갈비 강타', '{{user}} 옆구리 베임'.
2. Match narration text to tag recipient. If "하리벨 어깨 후려쳤다" → `[SYSTEM|HP:-18 하리벨 어깨 피격]`, NOT `{{user}} 피격`.
3. Default targeting: Tank companions absorb front-line hits. Healers/supporters fewer hits (positioned behind). {{user}} hit when personally engaged / enemy targets them / no front-liner / companion sacrifice.
4. Wide AOE = split into multiple [SYSTEM|HP:-N] tags, each naming different recipient.
5. MANA tag = caster name ([SYSTEM|MANA:-25 오리히메 삼천결순 사용]).
6. HUNGER tag = activity context (party-wide OK, name single character if cooking/eating).

### FORBIDDEN
- ❌ Default all [SYSTEM|HP:-N] to "{{user}} 피격" when another companion narratively took the blow.
- ❌ Generic "파티가 피해를 입었다" without naming WHO.
- ❌ {{user}} damage when behind line + tank front.
- ❌ Mismatched narration vs tag description.

